                                    <h2 id="ipn-stay-in-touch">Stay in touch</h2>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     <p>Email the ICS Exchange team at <a class="col-list-2" href="mailto:goglobal@uvic.ca">goglobal@uvic.ca</a>&#160;&#160;</p>
